Package: ipmR
Type: Package
Title: Interviewer Performance Monitoring for MICS (R port of IPM v7)
Version: 0.4.5.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Hrair", "Wannis", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cobmahavishnu@gmail.com"),
    person("Pierre", "Martel", role = "ctb", comment = "Author of the original Stata IPM application v7.0.0"))
Description: R implementation of the Interviewer Performance Monitoring (IPM)
    application for MICS fieldwork data quality monitoring: questionnaires per
    team and day, completion rates, interview durations, household composition,
    birth histories, anthropometry heaping and out-of-range, and within-team
    flag analysis of interviewer bias. Adds a team scorecard, rule-based
    and AI-generated team action plans (aggregated statistics only are sent
    to the model) and a Shiny front-end.
